exit 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
invalid value "rainbow" for flag -color: invalid colour mode "rainbow" (want auto, always or never)
Usage: clowd check [--target cloud] [--json] [--color mode] [file.clowd ...]

With no files, checks every .clowd file in the current directory.

  -color auto
    	colour output: auto (when writing to a terminal and NO_COLOR is unset), always or never
  -json
    	print machine-readable JSON
  -target cloud
    	check against these clouds instead of the file's use lines (repeatable, or comma-separated)
